# Resources

*Introduction to Numerical Analysis by Josef Stoer and Roland Bulirsch* — reference for numerical methods and differential equation solvers

*Numerical Methods for Engineers by Steven Chapra and Raymond Canale* — reference for Euler and RK4 methods

*Modeling Infectious Diseases in Humans and Animals by Keeling and Rohani* — reference for epidemic modeling and SIR systems

*Python Documentation for NumPy and Matplotlib* — used for numerical computations and plotting

